{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21216","headline":"遣昼 · 元稹","name":"遣昼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"密竹有清阴，旷怀无尘滓。\n况乃秋日光，玲珑晓窗里。\n旬休聊自适，今辰日高起。\n栉沐坐前轩，风轻镜如水。\n开卷恣咏谣，望云闲徙倚。\n新菊媚鲜妍，短萍怜靃靡。\n埽除田地静，摘掇园蔬美。\n幽翫惬诗流，空堂称居士。\n客来伤寂寞，我念遗烦鄙。\n心迹两相忘，谁能验行止。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21216.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21216","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}